IMPORT prelude

-- The explorer's X2, for a start that is not a literal: `AT (10 + 5)` is 15,
-- so P's deadline is at 18. The explorer read only a literal `AT`, and took any
-- other start for 0.

DECLARE Person IS ONE OF P
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF a

GIVETH A DEONTIC Person Action
nonliteral MEANS PARTY P MUST a WITHIN 3 HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH BY P

#TRACE nonliteral AT (10 + 5) WITH
